    "author": "planttherapynp",
    "author_followers": "3109",
    "caption": "Mental Health Monday \ud83c\udf31 Consistency matters. Perfection doesn\u2019t. This is my anthurium Zara Michelle \u00d7 RVDP that carries visible evidence of the times my routine slipped\u2026 missed waterings, stress, and life getting in the way. Its older leaves are faded and spotted, but they\u2019re still viable, still contributing, and still helping support what comes next. Oh, and that new leaf? A reminder that imperfect care can still produce a beautiful result. All-or-nothing thinking turns one missed day into giving up completely: \u201cI already messed up, so why continue?\u201d But real progress isn\u2019t built by never falling out of rhythm. It\u2019s built by returning. Falling out of your routine doesn\u2019t erase your progress. You don\u2019t have to start over, you just have to continue where you left off. What\u2019s one routine you\u2019re ready to return to this week? Anthurium Zara Michelle \u00d7 RVDP \ud83c\udf31 #mentalhealthmonday #planttherapy #youareenough #Anthurium #indoorgreenhouse ",
